    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d234">

                <pb facs="0357" n="310" xml:id="pg310"/>

                <head>234. Telegram 7 from Geneva to Hong Kong<anchor n="1" xml:id="d234-f1"
                    /></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Geneva</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1955-09-26">September 26, 1955, 5
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d234-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d234-1"/>
                <p>7. From Johnson.</p>
                <p>Nicholson, American Red Cross, would appreciate information from you and/or
                    Tomlin on whether American civilians recently released from prison report having
                    received packages transmitted at Hong Kong through Red Cross channels.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Shillock</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
